SET temp_dir = NULL

FINALLY:
    IF temp_dir != NULL:
        DO Remove this run's ADF output/temp directory only; report cleanup errors.

CHECK mode == "publish"

CHECK The developer explicitly requested publishing this estimate.

CHECK Saved estimate is complete/placeholder-free and supported: six rows/order/fields,
    nonnegative integer team scores (fallback 0 = no work, 1–3 = increasing complexity), zeros
    explained, categorized reasons/uncertainty, no double-counting, correct six-score total, and
    supported numeric Final Estimate ending in SP; no invented formulas. Report missing fields
    without rewriting.

DO Resolve private absolute acli/ix under shared Inux guidance; report missing tools without
    setup/login/probes. Use only exact subcommand help when needed.

SHELL `{acli} jira workitem comment list --key {ticket_id} --json --paginate` AS comments_result

SET comments = JSON(stdout of comments_result)

DO Check comments for duplicates/clarifications; record Boolean evidence_contradicts_draft and
    identical_comment plus duplicate URL. Never replace unrelated comments.

IF evidence_contradicts_draft == TRUE:
    ASK "Jira evidence contradicts the saved estimate. Would you like to revise it?" AS revision_request

    STOP "Publication stopped because evidence contradicts the draft; the saved estimate is unchanged."

IF identical_comment == FALSE:
    DO Read ../cli.md for ix ADF conversion; never build ADF manually.

    DO Create unique temp_dir; set absolute adf_path inside it.

    SHELL `{ix} adf {estimate_path} {adf_path}` AS adf_result

    DO Inspect ADF for faithful saved-estimate conversion.

    DO Immediately before posting, recheck ticket ID/content against saved_estimate; record
        current_ticket_id and Boolean estimate_is_unchanged.

    CHECK current_ticket_id == ticket_id

    CHECK estimate_is_unchanged == TRUE

    SHELL `{acli} jira workitem comment create --key {ticket_id} --body-file {adf_path} --json` AS publish_result

    SET published = JSON(stdout of publish_result)

    DO Retain returned comment/ticket URL from published; look up only if absent.

ELSE:
    DO Retain identical comment URL/status for the reply; do not post.

PRINT with ticket_id, SP, file/verified URL, assumptions, unrelated gaps, justified SP changes, and
    requested explanation; brief unless asked. Preserve task files on publish; inspect remote state
    before uncertain-write retries.
